WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Start the sealed-asset portal fixture against the configured public devnet.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
narrator: RPC availability and the demo Circle are external dependencies.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:13.000
narrator: Probe local health and resolve the fixture Circle ID.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:28.000
narrator: Request the sealed policy using the demonstration passphrase.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:45.000
narrator: Fetch headers, save the policy, and inspect the local file.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:57.000
narrator: The sealed control requires a successful fetch, then exact decrypt exit five with no plaintext.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.000
narrator: Stop the portal fixture.
